The Role:&nbsp;Senior Account&nbsp;Executive, Sweepstakes &nbsp;

Genius Sports powers a new era of sports for fans worldwide by merging next-gen technology with premium live data. Following our acquisition of Legend, we are rapidly expanding our sponsorship and media sales footprint across premium brands like Covers and&nbsp;Oddspedia. &nbsp;

We are hiring a&nbsp; Senior&nbsp;Account&nbsp;Executive&nbsp; to join&nbsp;this&nbsp;fast-growing sweepstakes casino segment. In this role, you will partner with the world’s biggest brands and impact millions of customers across 40+ US states.
&nbsp; &nbsp;

What&nbsp;You’ll&nbsp;Do:&nbsp; &nbsp;

As a Senior AE, you will drive business growth,&nbsp;optimize&nbsp;advertising partnerships, and serve as a key commercial bridge across internal and external teams. &nbsp;

• Partnership Growth : Proactively&nbsp;identify&nbsp;and secure new affiliate advertising partners. &nbsp;

• Relationship Management : Serve as the primary point of contact to nurture and scale partner relationships. &nbsp;

• Portfolio Optimization : Manage existing partner portfolios,&nbsp;monitor&nbsp;conversions, and refine advertising agreements to maximize revenue. &nbsp;

• Inbound Commercials : Evaluate incoming advertising inquiries to capture new business opportunities. &nbsp;

• Cross-Functional Collaboration : Align with Tech, Conversion, Marketing, and Content teams to deploy high-performing advertising campaigns. &nbsp;

• Knowledge Sharing : Work with internal squads to lead commercial initiatives and share strategic market insights. &nbsp;

• Content &amp; Performance : Oversee on-site content updates and pitch continuous commercial improvements. &nbsp;

• Compliance &amp; Finance : Resolve regulatory compliance issues and collaborate with Finance to track invoices and secure&nbsp;timely&nbsp;payments. &nbsp;

• Reporting : Generate comprehensive performance and earnings reports for senior stakeholders. &nbsp;

&nbsp; &nbsp;

What You'll Bring &nbsp;

We are looking for a&nbsp;commercially-minded&nbsp;relationship builder with deep roots in the iGaming and affiliate landscape. &nbsp;

• Industry Expertise : Proven experience working within an online gambling affiliate or operator environment. &nbsp;

• Commercial Acumen : Ability to extract actionable insights from affiliate platform performance metrics. &nbsp;

• Strategic Prioritization : Strong framework for prioritizing tasks based on current value and future revenue potential. &nbsp;

• Network : An extensive, active network of established operator relationships. &nbsp;

• Affiliate Dynamics : Deep understanding of the affiliate route to market, including revenue levers and commercial models that drive mutual value. &nbsp;
